  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "30 MINUTES LABEL新ブランド 「30 MINUTES PREFERENCE」よりアニメ「ぼっち・ざ・ろっく！」後藤ひとりを豊富な付属パーツとともに商品化！",
      "en": "From the new 30 MINUTES LABEL brand \"30 MINUTES PREFERENCE \", Hitori Goto from the anime \" Bocchi Za Rock!\" is commercialized with a variety of accessory parts!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• タンポ印刷を施した2種類のフェイスパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Two types of face parts with tampo printing are included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 印刷無しのフェイスパーツと、多数の表情を選択できる水転写式デカールが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with unprinted face parts and water transfer decals that allow you to choose from a variety of facial expressions."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 演奏中の姿勢に合わせた動きのあるスカートが差し替えパーツで付属。",
      "en": "• A skirt with movement that matches the posture during performance is included as a replacement part."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 前屈した演奏姿勢を表現できる胴体構造に加え、俯いた状態の前髪を差し替えパーツで再現。",
      "en": "• In addition to the torso structure that can express a forward-bent playing posture, the bangs in a bowed position are reproduced with replacement parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ギターのストラップは資材を採用し、ポージングに合わせてフレキシブルに形を変えることができる。",
      "en": "• The guitar strap is made of materials that can be flexibly changed to suit different poses."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 左手首の“結束バンド”ストラップパーツは着脱が可能。",
      "en": "• The \"cable band\" strap part on the left wrist is removable."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ボトルネック奏法を再現できる、空き瓶パーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Empty bottle parts are included to recreate bottleneck playing techniques."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 新規造形を含む、表情豊かなハンドパーツ各種が付属。",
      "en": "• Includes various expressive hand parts, including new models."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 差し替え式でSTARRYライブ、文化祭ライブの衣装を再現可能。",
      "en": "• Replaceable costumes allow you to recreate the costumes from STARRY Live and School Festival Live."
    }
  ],
